    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to implement **one** of the following rules:\r\n\r\n   a. The lights turn on only if motion is detected **AND** it is nighttime.\r\n\r\n   b. The lights turn on if motion is detected **OR** it is nighttime.\r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n",
